<title>UK: Pittencrieff Resources has takeover offer.</title>
<headline>Pittencrieff Resources has takeover offer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil and gas development company Pittencrieff Resources said on Wednesday it had signed a conditional letter of intent with the U.S.-based Gothic Energy Corporation which could lead to a cash offer for Pittencrieff.</p>
<p>Pittencrieff said the takeover offer price would be at 60 pence per share.  </p>
<p>The share price of Pittencrieff closed unchanged at 42-1/2 pence on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company said it would make further announcement on the transaction within a month.</p>
<p>Based in Tulsa, Oklahama, Gothic is advised by Oppenheimer &amp; Co.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
